OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells and
OL,7,Fturning quite chilly in some sheltered
OL,8,Fglens. Cloud will increase overnight
OL,9,Fwith rain, some heavy, following from
OL,10,Fthe southwest after midnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy with rain at first,
OL,13,Fbecoming drier and brighter in the
OL,14,Feast during the morning. Cloudy
OL,15,Fafternoon with drizzle in the west,
OL,16,Fbright warm spells in the east. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
